# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in. Every cluster-facing npm script in
# this package loads it via `node --env-file-if-exists=.env`, which is a no-op
# when the file is absent -- so CI, which supplies these through workflow env
# instead, is unaffected.

# Private devnet RPC. The public endpoint (https://api.devnet.solana.com) is
# the default, but it rate-limits hard enough that bootstrap's smoke lifecycle
# cannot reliably complete against it -- three consecutive runs died on 429s
# and dropped connections. Any private provider works; Helius devnet is
# https://devnet.helius-rpc.com/?api-key=<key>
#
# NOTE the DEVNET host. A mainnet URL here would point every devnet script at
# the wrong cluster.
VSOL_RPC_URL=https://devnet.helius-rpc.com/?api-key=your-key-here

# Optional: Pyth Hermes endpoint and API key. Defaults to the public
# https://hermes.pyth.network with no token.
# PYTH_HERMES_URL=
# PYTH_API_KEY=

# Optional: skips bootstrap's adversarial smoke lifecycle, producing a real
# deployment record with smokeStatus "skipped" rather than "passed".
# Not a substitute for a full run before anything that matters.
# VSOL_SKIP_SMOKE=1
